# Azure OpenAI credentials for the LangGraph agent (src/mocolens/agent/).
# From your Foundry project's Overview page at ai.azure.com: the API key, and the
# *Azure OpenAI* endpoint (https://<resource-name>.openai.azure.com/) - not the project
# endpoint (https://<resource-name>.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/<project>).
# A standalone Azure OpenAI resource works too ("Keys and Endpoint" in the Azure Portal).
# Deployment (default gpt-5.4-mini) and API version default in src/mocolens/agent/llm.py;
# set AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT / AZURE_OPENAI_API_VERSION to override them.
AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY=
AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://<your-resource-name>.openai.azure.com/
